    "intro_narrative": "You are an apprentice mechanist trapped in the legendary subterranean workshop of the eccentric inventor, Dr. Thaddeus Gearwright. The main boiler is rapidly overheating, and the blast doors have sealed shut. The air is thick with hissing steam, the smell of ozone, and the relentless clacking of brass gears. To prevent a catastrophic explosion and escape the facility, you must navigate a complex series of interconnected pneumatic devices and steam-powered analytical engines. Use logical deduction to restore the workshop's balance before the pressure gauge reaches the critical redline.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
